      "displayText": "다르거든요!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4B974AC70B4E0C6940021002100100002011401470000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "데미지를 받지 않는다는 효과는\n똑같긴 하지만...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
